  "name": "PvP Power raises periodic healing",
  "contract": "Requires PvpPower.Enable = 1. A High-Risk level 60 priest wearing two PvP Power +42 pieces (84 x 0.02% = 1.68%) heals more with Renew than the same gear does with PvP Power disabled. Each piece's authored 30 spell power is cut by the content scaling: both are Classic item level 74 without a generated profile, so the RAID_MID band (69-75 -> 52-58) puts them at 57 and 30 x 57/74 rounds to 23. The PvP Power +42 comes from the spell id and is not cut. 46 x 0.376 = 17.3 more per tick gives 122/105 of the naked total without the script and floor(122 x 1.0168) = 124/105 = 1.181 with it. Each tick is floored, so the gain shows as 2 of 105 rather than the full 1.68%.",
